  <summary>A guided desktop workspace for Linux server operations.</summary>
  <description>Chocolatey package 0.4.0-preview0012 installs application version 0.4.0-preview.12. This is a free proprietary preview release with guided SSH connections, Hestia website/account/mailbox management, protected code editing, scoped MariaDB SQL with backup/recovery, authoritative cPanel DNS and beginner guides. Installs for the current user. DirectAdmin and unverified public DNS/mail cutover routes remain gated. Unsigned installer; no Store certification is claimed.</description>
